===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fro|beduin}} (compare {{cog|fr|bédouin}}), from {{der|en|ar||بَدَوِين}}, colloquial plural of {{m|ar|بَدَوِيّ}}, from {{m|ar|بَدْو||desert, camp}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈbɛd.wɪn/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A member of [[nomad]]ic Arab tribes dwelling in the [[desert]].

